    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970409.0392\n\nPORT-AU-PRINCE, April 9 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nHaitian parliament boosts police firepower\n\n\n\n\nThe Haitian Chamber of Deputies has authorized some units of the national police to carry light weapons in addition to their sidearms, parliamentary sources said Wednesday.\n\nThe move is a reaction to rising violence, especially in Haiti's urban areas. Eight policemen have been gunned down in recent weeks.\n\nThe parliamentary list of authorized weapons includes submachine guns and assault rifles. Until now, police have carried only Smith and Wesson .38-caliber handguns.",
